# What NOT to upload to Vercel.
#
# Without this file Vercel falls back to .gitignore, which excludes ALL of
# public/data/*.json -- including the bounded index the deployment needs. The
# result builds cleanly and then 503s on every search, which is the worst
# possible failure: it looks like a working deploy.

node_modules
.next
.git
.vercel

# The full corpus. 382MB and 775MB respectively -- far past any serverless
# bundle limit, and the reason jobs-deploy.json exists.
public/data/jobs-v2.json
public/data/jobs-v2-full.json
public/data/jobs-snapshot.json
public/data/ibm-jobs.json

# Crawler state: large, machine-local, and meaningless in a read-only runtime.
.ingest-state.json

# The vendored location dataset is ~2.5GB of SQL/CSV used only by seed scripts.
countries-states-cities-database

# Offline research exports.
docs/reports

*.log
